## Scenario

In this assignment, you will be programming a **taxi agent (T)** that navigates a **7×7** city grid with **road blocks (obstacles) (indicated by #)**.

The taxi (T) has a two-stage job:
1. **Pick up** a passenger at the **Pickup** cell `P`
2. **Drop off** the passenger at the **Destination** cell `D`

The taxi must learn to **minimize energy (fuel/time)** while completing the job using Q-Learning following ε-greedy policy.

---

